Subject: Same-realm return

What this does
  Same-realm return.

Why we need it
  The light return loaded the caller's `c->b->realm` on every call.

What it adds
  Record same-realm in `hdr_pack` and branch to dispatch with `ctx` instead.

Needs a bytecode version bump
  No.
diff --git a/quickjs.c b/quickjs.c
index 364265d..b3912c8 100644
--- a/quickjs.c
